{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The perimeter of the polygon shown is \n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f19e2361261c1f97b4b8c8b6958ec7f30d342c8e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,6)--(8,6)--(8,3)--(2.7,3)--(2.7,0)--cycle); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(0,3),W); label(&quot;$8$&quot;,(4,6),N); draw((0.5,0)--(0.5,0.5)--(0,0.5)); draw((0.5,6)--(0.5,5.5)--(0,5.5)); draw((7.5,6)--(7.5,5.5)--(8,5.5)); draw((7.5,3)--(7.5,3.5)--(8,3.5)); draw((2.2,0)--(2.2,0.5)--(2.7,0.5)); draw((2.7,2.5)--(3.2,2.5)--(3.2,3)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"198\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/2588274f0d99112567cf44c98867faee055b9b22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 28 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"294\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/3/cd37ade3958f3106b275bf1678a68a7af0005f0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}\\ \\text{cannot be determined from the information given}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"389\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The unlabeled vertical sides must have total length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> while the unlabeled horizontal sides must have total length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus the unlabeled sides have total length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the total perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44beda3bc24bb460437600f60650106f10637459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 + 6 + 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"171\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c2c60ec3f042b22a74ebe21e5a64a6233dfa214.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(12); draw((0,0)--(0,6)--(8,6)--(8,3)--(2.7,3)--(2.7,0)--cycle); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(0,3),W); label(&quot;$8$&quot;,(4,6),N); draw((8,3)--(8,0)--(2.7,0),dashed); [/asy]\" width=\"182\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p>Extend two unlabeled sides of the original figure form a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38f688b7e8003bb3b5d9c6e7a1fdd1c1d8c00bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\times 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> rectangle, as shown.  Notice that the extensions added to these two sides are the same lengths as the other two unlabeled sides of the original figure, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38f688b7e8003bb3b5d9c6e7a1fdd1c1d8c00bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\times 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> rectangle has the same perimeter as the original figure.  Therefore, the perimeter of the original figure is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de47679814c0d02060c783849fdb0bd0f60f5db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(6+8) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"153\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017175647\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 121/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2302/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2604/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.576      1 -total\n 55.92%    7.033      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n 41.51%    5.220      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7679:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017175647 and revision id 282104. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}